    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.indentscope\n\n### Description\n\nI would like to configure the priority with indentscope to make it work with plugin nvim-ufo, i.e still display in folded line.\r\n![Screenshot 2023-03-03 at 16 23 48](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/12573521/222775452-d18c9fd1-bc27-4841-8fac-636f7fe1e363.png)\r\n\r\nSomething similar to indent-blankline.nvim `vim.g.indent_blankline_char_priority = 10`?",
